<NAME>RFP 22-04 Summary</NAME>
<CONTENT>Under RFP 22-04, INPRS anticipates hiring two Core Plus Fixed Income managers. The total combined mandate size for these hires is approximately $185 million. The benchmark identified for this mandate is the Bloomberg U.S. Aggregate Bond Index. These details are cited from Section 3, Scope of Services, in the referenced RFP material.</CONTENT>
