The evidence further notes that Lincoln Financial is responsible for basic administration, enrollment, participant communication and education, investment management, and recordkeeping. While exhibit-level data lists the main County plan at $162,847,830 as of 12/31/25, the RFP’s summarized total across the 457 Plans is approximately $167 million.</CONTENT>
