<NAME>Copies and deadline</NAME>
<CONTENT>The education foundation RFP is the “Request for Proposal to Provide Investment Manager Services for Broward Education Foundation, Inc.” In Section III, it says proposals are limited to no longer than 5 single-spaced typewritten pages, excluding backup documents and addenda such as references and samples.

In Section V, “Submission of Proposals,” the RFP states that proposers must submit six (6) copies of the proposal. It further states that the proposals must be submitted no later than 5 PM on July 1, 2016. Therefore, the required submission is six copies, due by 5:00 PM on July 1, 2016.</CONTENT>
